  "problem": "Consider the following initial value problem:\n\n$$\n{y}^{\u2032}=-2x-y,\\,y(0)=2\n$$\n\nWe wish to approximate the solution using the Runge-Kutta (RK4) method. Complete the first row of the table below, given that the step size is $\u0394x=\\frac{1}{2}.$\n\n| $\\,x\\,$ | $\\,y\\,$ | $\\,{y}^{\u2032}\\,$ | $\\,{y}_{1}^{\u2032}\\,$ | $\\,{y}_{2}^{\u2032}\\,$ | $\\,{y}_{3}^{\u2032}\\,$ | $\u0394y$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $0$ | $2$ | $-2$ | $-2$ | $-2$ | {{field-1}} | {{field-2}} |\n| $\\,\\frac{1}{2}$ | {{field-3}} |  |  |  |  |  |",
